OL,3,AIran executes three men for 'armed
OL,4,Aunrest' after January protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran has executed three men accused of
OL,7,Fcarrying out armed unrest during
OL,8,FJanuary's anti-government protests,
OL,9,Faccording to state media.
OL,11,FHassan Dioband, Hamid Kazemi and Reza
OL,12,FZanganeh were accused of throwing
OL,13,FMolotov cocktails and grenades, using
OL,14,Fbladed weapons and firearms, and
OL,15,Fsetting fire to public facilities in
OL,16,Fthe city of Karaj, west of Tehran,
OL,17,FIran's state news agency Tasnim
OL,18,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
