OL,3,AIran executes three men for 'armed
OL,4,Aunrest' after January protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe executions are the latest in a
OL,7,Fseries linked to the protests,
OL,8,Fincluding those of people accused of
OL,9,Fhaving ties to Israel and the United
OL,10,FStates.
OL,12,FThe number of executions in Iran has
OL,13,Fincreased since US-Israeli strikes on
OL,14,Fthe Islamic Republic began in late
OL,15,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
